NOTE ON MODEL WEIGHTS

The pre-converted model weights in nisqa_jax/weights/ (*.npz) are derived from
the original NISQA checkpoints created by Gabriel Mittag (TU Berlin). The
original weights are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-
NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0). See
nisqa_jax/weights/LICENSE_model_weights for the full text.

This MIT license applies to the source code of this JAX port only. The
weights retain their original CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license, which prohibits
commercial use.

NOTE ON ACADEMIC ATTRIBUTION

If you use this port in research, please cite the original NISQA paper:
Mittag, G., et al. "NISQA: A Deep CNN-Self-Attention Model for Multidimensional
Speech Quality Prediction with Crowdsourced Datasets." Interspeech 2021.
See CITATION.cff for the BibTeX entry.
